OL,3,GNEWSAFerry farewell after decades of
OL,4,AChannel crossings
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the car ferry Barfleur sails out
OL,7,Fof Poole Harbour on Monday, it will
OL,8,Fmark the end of more than three decades
OL,9,Fof sailing between the Dorset coast and
OL,10,FNormandy.
OL,12,FBrittany Ferries announced earlier this
OL,13,Fyear that the route would be ended and
OL,14,Fthe ferry sold as part of its plans to
OL,15,Fcope with financial challenges.
OL,17,FCountless travellers have embarked on
OL,18,Fholidays, school visits or day trips,
OL,19,Fwhile for anyone living and working
OL,20,Fwithin sight of Poole Harbour, the ship
OL,21,Fhas been a regular sight.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
