OL,3,GNEWSAFerry farewell after decades of
OL,4,AChannel crossings
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarfleur is due to arrive in Poole on
OL,7,Fits last sailing from Normandy on
OL,8,FSunday at 21:45 BST before departing
OL,9,Ffor the final time at 08:30 on Monday.
